				<h2 class="newsletter-article-title">USDOT Hosts Automated Vehicle Peer Exchange in San Francisco</h2>
				<div class="newsletter-article-content">
					<p>
						USDOT convened leading and emerging states and cities for an Automated
						Vehicle (AV) Peer Exchange in San Francisco, California, hosted in
						partnership with the San Francisco County Transportation Authority
						(SFCTA). Participants shared their experiences advancing automated
						vehicle deployments in their jurisdictions, took rides with leading
						AV providers, and toured a Waymo Depot and Contra Costa
						Transportation Authority's GoMentum Station. Local university students
						also presented their latest AV research.
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>

