				<h2 class="newsletter-article-title">Missed the ITS JPO Procurement National Webinar?<br />Materials Available!</h2>
				<div class="newsletter-article-content">
					<p>
						The ITS JPO held a three-hour national webinar (virtual) on September 17,
						2026, on &ldquo;Demystifying SI Procurement: Actionable Strategies for
						Transportation Agencies,&rdquo; featuring 10 speakers from State DOTs,
						local agencies, transit agencies, and Metropolitan Planning
						Organizations. The webinar drew nearly 300 attendees from public
						sector agencies across the multimodal transportation landscape with
						varying levels of experience with procurement of advanced analytics
						and intelligence. The webinar examined how transportation agencies
						can navigate procurement, with presentations and panels organized
						around three procurement phases: Pre-Award, Award, and Post-Award.
						Presentation materials from the webinar are now posted on the ITS
						JPO website.
					</p>
