				<h2 class="newsletter-article-title">ITS4US Deployment Accelerator Now Accepting Proposals</h2>
				<div class="newsletter-article-content">
					<p>
						The ITS4US Deployment Accelerator BAA is now live! The Program will provide
						seed funding to up to five sites to rapidly replicate the ITS4US
						Heart of Iowa Regional Transit Agency's Health Connector project,
						which connects transportation to healthcare appointments. Awardees
						will join a cohort of deployers receiving technical assistance and
						support to deploy solutions within their communities within 12
						months. Proposed multi-disciplinary teams must include a mobility
						service operator or provider, a software integrator, and a public
						or private healthcare partner.
