				<h2 class="newsletter-article-title">Freight Corridor Predictive Intelligence (FCPI) Project Awards Announced</h2>
				<div class="newsletter-article-content">
					<p>
						The FCPI project is a USDOT FY26 Small Business Innovation Research (SBIR)
						initiative seeking to develop an intelligent predictive system that
						fuses multimodal data to forecast freight bottlenecks and supply
						chain disruptions along U.S. freight corridors. Three projects were
						recently awarded:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>&ldquo;FCPI: A Freight-First Corridor Forecast&rdquo; with Connect Dynamics, Inc. DBA FR8relay (Bentonville, AR)</li>
						<li>&ldquo;Predictive Resilience and Edge Decision Intelligence for Corridor Transportation (PREDICT)&rdquo; with ecoLong, LLC (Albany, NY)</li>
						<li>&ldquo;CorridorCast: Predictive Freight Corridor Intelligence&rdquo; with Factor, Inc. (Nashville, TN)</li>
